<title>USA: GNI Group Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>GNI Group Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited)</p>
<p>							  THREE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>								     March 31,</p>
<p>						     1997		 1996</p>
<p>    Revenues			    $10,584,091     $  9,943,422</p>
<p>    Operating income (loss)	  1,715,644	 (7,059,857)</p>
<p>    Income (loss) before tax	 1,003,675	 (7,472,255)</p>
<p>    Net income (loss)		    640,875	 (4,929,855)</p>
<p>    Net income (loss) per share  $	0.09     $	(0.75)</p>
<p>Shares used to calculate earnings per share</p>
<p>						7,358,115	  6,565,233</p>
<p>					  NINE MONTHS ENDED    March 31,</p>
<p>							1997		1996</p>
<p>    Revenues			     $31,206,189     $28,672,455</p>
<p>    Operating income (loss)	   5,351,739	(4,096,588)</p>
<p>    Income (loss) before tax	  3,614,654	(5,142,515)</p>
<p>    Net income (loss)		   2,296,354	(3,454,015)</p>
<p>    Net income (loss) per share   $	 .33     $	(.53)</p>
<p>Shares used to calculate earnings per share</p>
<p>						 7,062,539	 6,510,628</p>
<p>NOTE:  Results for the three- and nine-month periods of 1996 include a pretax charge of about $6.7 million for the impairment of assets under FASB No. 121; after taxes the net charge was about $4.4 million or $.68 per share.</p>
